        "jsCode": "let dify={};let r2={};try{dify=$('[D07] 汇总Dify').first().json}catch{try{dify=$('[D08] 无Dify任务').first().json}catch{}}try{r2=$('[R07] 汇总R2').first().json}catch{try{r2=$('[R08] 无R2任务').first().json}catch{}}let gate={};for(const i of $input.all()){const j=i.json??{};if(Array.isArray(j)&&j[0]){gate=j[0];break}if(Array.isArray(j.body)&&j.body[0]){gate=j.body[0];break}if(j.recommended_action){gate=j;break}}const now=new Intl.DateTimeFormat('zh-CN',{timeZone:'Asia/Shanghai',year:'numeric',month:'2-digit',day:'2-digit',hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit',second:'2-digit',hour12:false}).format(new Date()).replace(/\\//g,'-');const issue=Number(dify.dify_failed||0)>0||Number(r2.r2_missing||0)>0||Number(r2.r2_failed||0)>0;const text=`${issue?'⚠️':'✅'} WeRSS Dify R2 状态一致性检查完成\\n\\n工作流：${$workflow.name}\\n执行 ID：${$execution.id}\\n完成时间：${now}\\n\\nDify领取检查：${Number(dify.dify_checked||0)}\\n已完成：${Number(dify.dify_completed||0)}\\n仍处理中：${Number(dify.dify_processing||0)}\\n失败：${Number(dify.dify_failed||0)}\\n\\nR2领取检查：${Number(r2.r2_checked||0)}\\n验证成功：${Number(r2.r2_verified||0)}\\n对象缺失：${Number(r2.r2_missing||0)}\\n验证失败：${Number(r2.r2_failed||0)}\\n\\n推荐动作：${gate.recommended_action||'unknown'}\\n${gate.recommended_action_detail||''}\\n主工作流门禁：${gate.safe_to_run_main_workflow?'允许':'阻止'}\\nDify processing：${Number(gate.dify_processing_count||0)}\\nDify stale：${Number(gate.dify_processing_stale_count||0)}\\nDify待提交：${Number(gate.dify_queue_count||0)}\\nR2 missing：${Number(gate.r2_missing_count||0)}\\nR2 error：${Number(gate.r2_error_count||0)}`;return[{json:{...dify,...r2,...gate,success:!issue,feishu_text:text}}];"
